flowchart LR
 _Prelude_(["Impersonate your way into the lavish penthouse and clean out the owners&#39; valuables."])
 _A1_(["Posing as a maintenance technician, Imitator #1 knocks on the penthouse door."])
 _A1_1_(["Imitator #1 asks the owner if she&#39;s noticed a strange smell recently."])
 _A1_2_(["Pretending to be Imitator #1&#39;s colleague, Looter #1 approaches."])
 _A1_2_Cont_(["Looter #1 claims the neighbors are concerned about a gas-like odor on this floor."])
 _A1_3_(["The owner asks the team to wait while she speaks to her husband."])
 _A1_C1_{"Imitator #1 and Looter #1 demand immediate entry, citing building regulations."}
 _A1_C1P_["The owner gives in and allows Imitator #1 and Looter #1 to enter."]
 _A2_(["Her husband shows up to see what all the fuss is about."])
 _A2_1_(["Imitator #1 repeats the story while Looter #1 investigates the property."])
 _A2_2_(["Looter #1 says there&#39;s evidence that the gas supply has been tampered with."])
 _A2_3_(["As the couple protests, Looter #1 says she&#39;s going to get the building manager."])
 _A2_4_(["Imitator #2 arrives looking serious with an ID badge dangling around his neck."])
 _A2_5_(["Imitator #2 grills them about the leak, hinting it’s time to come clean."])
 _A2_5_Cont_(["The owners become irate and passionately deny the crew&#39;s accusations."])
 _A2_C1_{"Imitator #2 orders the couple to vacate the property ahead of a full investigation."}
 _A2_C1F_["The owners refuse to cooperate, insisting the accusation is preposterous."]
 _A2_C2_{"Imitator #2 warns them that their situation will get worse if they refuse to comply."}
 _A2_C2P_["The implied threat of violence convinces the couple to start packing their things."]
 _A3_(["Realizing they may be taking valuables with them, Imitator #2 insists they leave now."])
 _A3_1_(["The couple refuses to rush, insisting they must collect their belongings first."])
 _A3_2_(["Disguised as engineers, the rest of the team arrives."])
 _A3_3_(["Noticing Imitator #3&#39;s shifty demeanor, the husband demands to see some identification."])
 _A3_C1_{"Imitator #3 flashes her ID card and smiles at the man."}
 _A3_C1P_["The owner backs down while reiterating their innocence."]
 _A4_(["Looter #3 directs Imitator #2 to remove the couple from the premises."])
 _A4_1_(["The owners are escorted outside by Imitator #2 for further questioning."])
 _A4_2_(["With the penthouse to themselves, the team scours it for valuables."])
 _A4_R1_(["Imitator #3 discovers a walk-in closet tucked away in the corner."])
 _A4_3_(["The closet contains a pack of pixie sticks hidden beneath a jacket."])
 _A4_4_(["Inside a cabinet, Looter #3 finds a stash of pixie sticks!"])
 _A4_5_(["Looter #3 crouches down and spots a keypad-locked refrigeration unit under the worktop."])
 _A4_6_(["Looter #3 sees that the unit requires a four-digit code to unlock it."])
 _A4_7_(["Some of the buttons on the keypad are faded, hinting at the combination."])
 _A4_C1_{"Looter #3 tries to guess the passcode using this information."}
 _A4_C1F_["The code fails and the fridge stays shut."]
 _A4_C2_{"A warning light indicates that Looter #3 has one attempt remaining."}
 _A4_C2F_["Looter #3 fails again and the passcode interface is disabled."]
 _A5_(["Meanwhile, Looter #2 stumbles upon a hidden door behind a bookshelf."])
 _A5_1_(["Looter #2 calls the team over, excited by this discovery."])
 _A5_C1_{"Unable to find a way through, Looter #2 and Looter #3 resort to brute force."}
 _A5_C1F_["Looter #2 charges at the door but it doesn’t budge an inch."]
 _B7_(["Imitator #2 rushes in, concern etched on his face."])
 _B7_1_(["Imitator #2 alerts the team that the owners have escaped and called the police."])
 _B7_2_(["The team heads out, resisting the temptation to see what lies behind the locked door."])
 _B7_3_(["Imitator #2 lags to shut the door and is unexpectedly confronted by a police officer."])
 _B7_C1_{"Imitator #2 tries to convince the cop he heard screams from within the penthouse."}
 _B7_C1F_["Imitator #2&#39;s performance is unconvincing and the cop grabs him to make an arrest."]
 _B7S2_(["With Imitator #2 booked, the team’s celebration is muted as they flee with the loot."])
 _A1_C1F_["The owner refuses, insisting they&#39;re making things up."]
 _A1_C2_{"Imitator #1 and Looter #1 tell her there&#39;s a serious risk of explosion."}
 _A1_C2P_["Wary of damage to her property, the owner allows the team to enter."]
 _A2_C1P_["Without resistance, the owners give in and start packing their things."]
 _A4_C2P_["A satisfying beep indicates that Looter #3 has finally guessed the passcode."]
 _A4_R5_(["The fridge unlocks with a click, revealing three chilled cans of Goose Juice."])
 _A5_C1P_["Looter #2&#39;s shoulder barge activates a hidden mechanism and the door slides open."]
 _A6_(["A crude distillery sits in the room&#39;s corner, rigged together with pipes and plastic tubs."])
 _A6_R2_(["Rooting through the setup, Looter #3 finds a single bottle of moonshine ready to go."])
 _A7_(["Imitator #2 bursts into the penthouse, panting heavily and clearly agitated."])
 _A7_1_(["Catching his breath, Imitator #2 reveals the owners escaped and called the cops."])
 _A7_2_(["The team rushes to the elevator, eager to make tracks."])
 _A7_3_(["A cop shows up, catching Imitator #2 before he can enter the elevator."])
 _A7_C1_{"Imitator #2 tries to deceive the officer by claiming the thieves ran down the stairs."}
 _A7_C1F_["The cop doesn&#39;t fall for Imitator #2&#39;s ruse and detains him for questioning."]
 _A7S2_(["The rest of the team escapes with their loot, leaving Imitator #2 to take the rap."])
 _A1_C2F_["The owner maintains she&#39;s smelled nothing untoward and closes the door."]
 _A1_C3_{"Imitator #1 and Looter #1 pound on the door, shouting that it&#39;s an emergency."}
 _A1_C3P_["The owner finally relents, granting them entry to end the disturbance."]
 _A4_C1P_["Thanks to intuition and luck, Looter #3 eventually finds the right combination."]
 _A4_R3_(["The refrigerator door opens, revealing two frosty cans of Damp Valley!"])
 _A4_R2_(["Looter #3 explores the kitchen, randomly opening cabinets as he goes."])
 _A4_R4_(["As the fridge door pops open, an ice cold can of Crocozade is revealed."])
 _B7_C1P_["The deception succeeds and the officer hurries inside to investigate."]
 _B7S_(["With the cop distracted, Imitator #2 is free to join his teammates and escape."])
 _A7_C1P_["The fool believes Imitator #2 and chases an imaginary team of criminals."]
 _A7S_(["Imitator #2 exits the building and rejoins the team to celebrate a successful caper."])
 _A6_R1_(["Looter #3 grabs two bottles of moonshine to toast their success."])
 _A3_C1F_["The owner isn&#39;t convinced and demands a police presence before he&#39;ll leave."]
 _A3_C2_{"Imitator #3 offers to deal with the issue discreetly, saving them from prosecution."}
 _A3_C2F_["The husband pretends to comply, before punching Imitator #3 and making a run for it."]
 _A3_4_(["Despite the drama, the crew stays calm, knowing the couple can&#39;t escape."])
 _A3_5_(["As they move toward him, the husband warns that he&#39;s got a gun and starts firing."])
 _A3_6_(["Looter #3 takes a shot to the abdomen and collapses in the hallway."])
 _A3F_(["With their plan for a stealthy heist in ruins, the team decides to withdraw."])
 _A3_C2P_["Fearing arrest, the owners give in and prepare to leave."]
 _B8_(["Looter #3 demands the property is searched from top to bottom."])
 _B8_1_(["Imitator #2 escorts the owners outside to keep them out of the way."])
 _B8_2_(["With the penthouse clear, the team starts searching for valuable items."])
 _B8_3_(["Under the kitchen worktop, Looter #3 finds a keypad protected refrigeration unit."])
 _B8_3_Cont_(["Some numbers on the keypad are faded, hinting at the combination."])
 _B8_C1_{"Looter #3 makes an educated guess based on the evidence available."}
 _B8_C1F_["The keypad flashes red and the unit stays locked."]
 _B8_4_(["Imitator #3 suggests he could look for a hammer to smash the fridge open."])
 _B8_5_(["Imitator #2 bursts in, interrupting to reveal that the owners have escaped."])
 _B8_6_(["The team rushes to the elevator, but Imitator #3 and Looter #3 stop to look for loot."])
 _B8_7_(["As the rest of the crew escapes, a brace of cops shows up."])
 _B8F_(["Imitator #3 and Looter #3 are intercepted by the officers and arrested on the spot."])
 _B8_C1P_["After a couple of attempts, Looter #3 manages to guess the code correctly!"]
 _B8_R2_(["With the fridge open, the team discovers a six-pack of ice cold Damp Valley."])
 _B9_(["Suddenly, Imitator #2 runs in to report that the owners have fled and called the cops."])
 _B9_1_(["The crew curses Imitator #2&#39;s ineptitude as they rush to leave the penthouse."])
 _B9S_(["With the law incoming, the team wastes no time fleeing to the elevators."])
 _A1_C3F_["Through the door, the woman can be heard calling the building&#39;s security team."]
 _A1F_(["Having failed to get past a frail old lady, the team exits before things escalate."])
 _B8_R1_(["The fridge door swings open to reveal four crisp cans of Crocozade."])
 _A2_C2F_["The husband becomes furious and pulls a gun on Imitator #2."]
 _A2_6_(["In the struggle, the gun discharges, a bullet striking Imitator #1 in the neck."])
 _A2_7_(["With blood oozing from Imitator #1&#39;s wound, everyone is stunned into silence."])
 _A2F_(["The team hauls their injured crewmate away, leaving a chaotic scene in their wake."])

